1
00:00:31,741 --> 00:00:34,784
<font color="#7e7c7c">He who possesses
the Spear of Destiny</font>

2
00:00:34,785 --> 00:00:37,703
<font color="#7e7c7c">holds the fate of the world
in his hands."</font>

3
00:00:37,704 --> 00:00:42,168
<font color="#7e7c7c">The Spear of Destiny has been missing
since the end of World War II.</font>

4
00:01:58,577 --> 00:02:00,955
<font color="#7e7c7c">Manuel!</font>

5
00:02:16,345 --> 00:02:18,848
<font color="#7e7c7c">Manuel!</font>

6
00:02:41,996 --> 00:02:46,500
<font color="#7e7c7c">CONSTANTINE</font>

7
00:03:55,527 --> 00:03:58,113
<font color="#7e7c7c">I think...</font>

8
00:03:59,323 --> 00:04:02,159
<font color="#7e7c7c">I think I found you one.</font>

9
00:04:04,912 --> 00:04:07,748
<font color="#7e7c7c">I called you, right?</font>

10
00:04:09,291 --> 00:04:14,255
<font color="#7e7c7c">Soon as I couldn't pull it out myself,
I called you, John.</font>

11
00:04:29,019 --> 00:04:32,606
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's okay.
We had to tie her down.</font>

12
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,748
<font color="#7e7c7c">This is Constantine.</font>

13
00:05:30,956 --> 00:05:34,585
<font color="#7e7c7c">John Constantine, asshole!</font>

14
00:05:43,552 --> 00:05:46,055
<font color="#7e7c7c">Sure.</font>

15
00:06:08,035 --> 00:06:10,412
<font color="#7e7c7c">What the hell?</font>

16
00:06:27,596 --> 00:06:31,767
<font color="#7e7c7c">I need a mirror.
Now! At least 3 feet high.</font>

17
00:06:32,226 --> 00:06:35,229
<font color="#7e7c7c">Move! Go, now!</font>

18
00:06:49,076 --> 00:06:51,452
<font color="#7e7c7c">This is Kramer.</font>

19
00:06:51,453 --> 00:06:54,123
<font color="#7e7c7c">Chas Kramer, asshole!</font>

20
00:06:56,333 --> 00:07:01,630
<font color="#7e7c7c">What? This is Kramer.
Chas Kramer, asshole!</font>

21
00:07:01,797 --> 00:07:04,006
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Chas!
- What?</font>

22
00:07:04,007 --> 00:07:06,510
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Move the car.
- Why?</font>

23
00:07:07,594 --> 00:07:10,389
<font color="#7e7c7c">Move the damn car!</font>

24
00:07:13,058 --> 00:07:15,477
<font color="#7e7c7c">"Chas, move the car."</font>

25
00:07:16,645 --> 00:07:19,064
<font color="#7e7c7c">There, car's moved.</font>

26
00:07:28,991 --> 00:07:31,368
<font color="#7e7c7c">Lift it up over the bed.</font>

27
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:36,832
<font color="#7e7c7c">Tie that end off.
Hennessy, over the top.</font>

28
00:07:38,459 --> 00:07:43,255
<font color="#7e7c7c">Close your eyes.
And whatever happens, don't look.</font>

29
00:07:55,476 --> 00:07:58,020
<font color="#7e7c7c">No!</font>

30
00:08:03,275 --> 00:08:05,903
<font color="#7e7c7c">Show yourself.</font>

31
00:08:10,073 --> 00:08:13,368
<font color="#7e7c7c">Smile pretty, you vain prick.</font>

32
00:08:20,751 --> 00:08:23,253
<font color="#7e7c7c">For your boss.</font>

33
00:08:23,670 --> 00:08:26,173
<font color="#7e7c7c">Pull it!</font>

34
00:08:51,615 --> 00:08:54,076
<font color="#7e7c7c">Ma?</font>

35
00:09:29,987 --> 00:09:34,240
<font color="#7e7c7c">Like I said, I found you something,
didn't I, John? Didn't I?</font>

36
00:09:34,241 --> 00:09:36,952
<font color="#7e7c7c">What happened in there?</font>

37
00:09:43,542 --> 00:09:49,006
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Going to a lot of meetings, I see.
- Keeps the voices out so I can sleep.</font>

38
00:09:49,381 --> 00:09:51,674
<font color="#7e7c7c">I have to sleep, John.</font>

39
00:09:51,675 --> 00:09:54,761
<font color="#7e7c7c">I need some help, Father.</font>

40
00:09:55,345 --> 00:09:58,140
<font color="#7e7c7c">You do? From me?</font>

41
00:09:58,932 --> 00:10:01,226
<font color="#7e7c7c">What kind of...?</font>

42
00:10:04,062 --> 00:10:08,150
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Listen, I...
- That exorcism wasn't right.</font>

43
00:10:10,319 --> 00:10:12,988
<font color="#7e7c7c">Listen to the ether.</font>

44
00:10:13,113 --> 00:10:16,491
<font color="#7e7c7c">Anything unusual,
you let me know.</font>

45
00:10:17,117 --> 00:10:22,748
<font color="#7e7c7c">You don't need its protection.
It'll be like back in the day.</font>

46
00:10:25,125 --> 00:10:28,170
<font color="#7e7c7c">- A few days.
- Okay.</font>

47
00:10:29,171 --> 00:10:31,965
<font color="#7e7c7c">Okay. For you, John.</font>

48
00:10:36,136 --> 00:10:39,889
<font color="#7e7c7c">John, why would you do that
if you know it's not my car?</font>

49
00:10:39,890 --> 00:10:41,724
<font color="#7e7c7c">I told you to move it.</font>

50
00:10:41,725 --> 00:10:46,395
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yes, but if you'd said you were dropping
a huge mirror with a pissed off demon,</font>

51
00:10:46,396 --> 00:10:48,647
<font color="#7e7c7c">I would've moved it further, John.</font>

52
00:10:48,649 --> 00:10:52,110
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Take Alvarado.
- Thank you. I know what to take.</font>

53
00:10:53,195 --> 00:10:57,198
<font color="#7e7c7c">You ever think if you told me more now
that maybe I could help out?</font>

54
00:10:57,199 --> 00:10:59,618
<font color="#7e7c7c">- No?
- Nope.</font>

55
00:10:59,868 --> 00:11:02,537
<font color="#7e7c7c">Of course it's a nope.</font>

56
00:11:39,157 --> 00:11:42,661
<font color="#7e7c7c">Bless me, Father,
for I have sinned.</font>

57
00:11:44,329 --> 00:11:46,707
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's been...</font>

58
00:11:47,207 --> 00:11:50,752
<font color="#7e7c7c">two weeks since
my last confession.</font>

59
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:56,049
<font color="#7e7c7c">I killed a man today.</font>

60
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:59,219
<font color="#7e7c7c">Another one.</font>

61
00:12:02,973 --> 00:12:06,435
<font color="#7e7c7c">I didn't even see his face.</font>

62
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:12,607
<font color="#7e7c7c">I just pulled the trigger,
and he went away.</font>

63
00:12:12,733 --> 00:12:17,612
<font color="#7e7c7c">Most cops go 20 years
without firing their guns.</font>

64
00:12:20,115 --> 00:12:23,618
<font color="#7e7c7c">Why do I always know
where these guys are?</font>

65
00:12:23,869 --> 00:12:26,830
<font color="#7e7c7c">Where to aim, when to fire.</font>

66
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:33,377
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm wondering, is there
something wrong with me, Father?</font>

67
00:12:33,378 --> 00:12:35,379
<font color="#7e7c7c">Something damned?</font>

68
00:12:35,380 --> 00:12:39,301
<font color="#7e7c7c">God has a plan for you.
He has a plan for us all.</font>

69
00:12:40,635 --> 00:12:45,264
<font color="#7e7c7c">You mustn't let your faith
be overshadowed by guilt.</font>

70
00:12:45,265 --> 00:12:48,018
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah, I'm trying.</font>

71
00:12:48,143 --> 00:12:51,104
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm trying real hard.</font>

72
00:12:52,814 --> 00:12:55,525
<font color="#7e7c7c">Isabel.</font>

73
00:13:44,533 --> 00:13:47,244
<font color="#7e7c7c">Isabel.</font>

74
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:45,884
<font color="#7e7c7c">Things I've beaten.</font>

75
00:14:45,886 --> 00:14:49,805
<font color="#7e7c7c">Things most people
never even heard of.</font>

76
00:14:49,806 --> 00:14:53,727
<font color="#7e7c7c">And now I'm gonna
be done in by this.</font>

77
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:57,147
<font color="#7e7c7c">Wouldn't be the first, John.</font>

78
00:14:58,398 --> 00:15:00,733
<font color="#7e7c7c">Come on, Les.</font>

79
00:15:00,734 --> 00:15:03,902
<font color="#7e7c7c">You saved me before,
you can do it again, right?</font>

80
00:15:03,904 --> 00:15:06,406
<font color="#7e7c7c">This is aggressive.</font>

81
00:15:07,324 --> 00:15:11,118
<font color="#7e7c7c">Twenty years ago,
you didn't wanna be here.</font>

82
00:15:11,119 --> 00:15:15,498
<font color="#7e7c7c">Now you don't wanna leave.
Yeah, that's a good idea.</font>

83
00:15:19,002 --> 00:15:22,297
<font color="#7e7c7c">John, you really need to prepare.</font>

84
00:15:25,091 --> 00:15:28,303
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Make arrangements.
- No need.</font>

85
00:15:28,845 --> 00:15:32,390
<font color="#7e7c7c">I already know exactly
where I'm going.</font>

86
00:15:36,227 --> 00:15:38,771
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Morning.
- Good morning.</font>

87
00:15:38,772 --> 00:15:41,315
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Good morning.
- Detective.</font>

88
00:15:41,316 --> 00:15:42,900
<font color="#7e7c7c">No.</font>

89
00:15:42,901 --> 00:15:46,863
<font color="#7e7c7c">Angela, wait.
You don't need to see this.</font>

90
00:15:47,197 --> 00:15:50,033
<font color="#7e7c7c">Give us the room, please.</font>

91
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:22,649
<font color="#7e7c7c">Isabel.</font>

92
00:16:28,738 --> 00:16:32,409
<font color="#7e7c7c">- She fell from the roof?
- She jumped.</font>

93
00:16:34,828 --> 00:16:36,954
<font color="#7e7c7c">No.</font>

94
00:16:36,955 --> 00:16:40,917
<font color="#7e7c7c">I know it's hard to accept.
She was sick.</font>

95
00:16:49,801 --> 00:16:53,263
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Isabel wouldn't kill herself.
- Angie.</font>

96
00:16:54,055 --> 00:16:58,143
<font color="#7e7c7c">She wouldn't kill herself.
Period!</font>

97
00:17:00,061 --> 00:17:03,648
<font color="#7e7c7c">Angie, there were
security cameras.</font>

98
00:17:13,533 --> 00:17:17,871
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Hold the door. You going down?
- Not if I can help it.</font>

99
00:18:07,629 --> 00:18:09,671
<font color="#7e7c7c">A new case?</font>

100
00:18:09,672 --> 00:18:15,011
<font color="#7e7c7c">The big score? The mother Iode?
The one you've been waiting for?</font>

101
00:18:15,261 --> 00:18:18,348
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Humor me.
- Don't I always?</font>

102
00:18:23,603 --> 00:18:27,440
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah, that's...
Much obliged. Thank you.</font>

103
00:18:28,650 --> 00:18:32,821
<font color="#7e7c7c">- How you feeling, John?
- So, what's new?</font>

104
00:18:36,574 --> 00:18:40,536
<font color="#7e7c7c">Bullet shavings from
the assassination attempt on the pope,</font>

105
00:18:40,537 --> 00:18:44,373
<font color="#7e7c7c">holy-water ampoules
from the River Jordan</font>

106
00:18:44,374 --> 00:18:48,795
<font color="#7e7c7c">and, you'll love this,
screech beetle from Amityville.</font>

107
00:18:51,714 --> 00:18:55,926
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's funny to you, but to the fallen,
that's like nails on a chalkboard.</font>

108
00:18:55,927 --> 00:18:59,389
<font color="#7e7c7c">What is it, exactly,
with you and bugs?</font>

109
00:18:59,514 --> 00:19:01,974
<font color="#7e7c7c">I just like them.</font>

110
00:19:01,975 --> 00:19:04,727
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah. Who doesn't?</font>

111
00:19:06,104 --> 00:19:08,230
<font color="#7e7c7c">Easy there, hero.</font>

112
00:19:08,231 --> 00:19:12,526
<font color="#7e7c7c">- That's dragon's breath.
- I thought you couldn't get it anymore.</font>

113
00:19:12,527 --> 00:19:15,864
<font color="#7e7c7c">I know a guy
who knows a guy.</font>

114
00:19:22,912 --> 00:19:25,540
<font color="#7e7c7c">So, what's the action?</font>

115
00:19:27,125 --> 00:19:31,087
<font color="#7e7c7c">I just pulled a soldier demon
out of a little girl.</font>

116
00:19:31,254 --> 00:19:34,966
<font color="#7e7c7c">Looked like it was trying
to come through.</font>

117
00:19:35,967 --> 00:19:38,093
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah, I know how it sounds.</font>

118
00:19:38,094 --> 00:19:41,556
<font color="#7e7c7c">We're finger puppets to them,
John, not doorways.</font>

119
00:19:41,723 --> 00:19:45,684
<font color="#7e7c7c">They can work us, but they can't
come through onto our plane.</font>

120
00:19:45,685 --> 00:19:50,148
<font color="#7e7c7c">Check the scrolls anyway.
See if there's any precedent.</font>

121
00:19:51,316 --> 00:19:53,400
<font color="#7e7c7c">Anything else?</font>

122
00:19:53,401 --> 00:19:57,113
<font color="#7e7c7c">Wouldn't happen to have
anything for a...?</font>

123
00:19:57,822 --> 00:20:00,198
<font color="#7e7c7c">On the house.</font>

124
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:05,079
<font color="#7e7c7c">Question. How much longer
do I have to be your slave, John?</font>

125
00:20:05,663 --> 00:20:08,416
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're not my slave, Chas.</font>

126
00:20:08,666 --> 00:20:13,630
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're my very appreciated apprentice.
Like Tonto or Robin.</font>

127
00:20:14,422 --> 00:20:17,341
<font color="#7e7c7c">Or that skinny fellow
with the fat friend.</font>

128
00:20:17,342 --> 00:20:23,223
<font color="#7e7c7c">So then why don't I apprentice
something besides driving, then, John?</font>

129
00:20:23,973 --> 00:20:26,351
<font color="#7e7c7c">John?</font>

130
00:20:26,893 --> 00:20:29,729
<font color="#7e7c7c">I love our little talks, John.</font>

131
00:20:43,034 --> 00:20:48,038
<font color="#7e7c7c">- May I take your coat, Mr. Constantine?
- No. I'm not gonna be staying long.</font>

132
00:20:48,039 --> 00:20:52,710
<font color="#7e7c7c">- How about you, ma'am?
- No, I'm not staying long either.</font>

133
00:20:52,961 --> 00:20:55,921
<font color="#7e7c7c">I need to speak with him.
It's very important.</font>

134
00:20:55,922 --> 00:20:58,508
<font color="#7e7c7c">First come, first served.</font>

135
00:21:01,261 --> 00:21:04,639
<font color="#7e7c7c">So you're rude
no matter where you are.</font>

136
00:21:13,273 --> 00:21:15,608
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Father.
- Hi.</font>

137
00:21:16,025 --> 00:21:20,363
<font color="#7e7c7c">- You have news.
- Yes, I spoke with the bishop.</font>

138
00:21:25,576 --> 00:21:28,245
<font color="#7e7c7c">I know what you want, son.</font>

139
00:21:28,246 --> 00:21:32,667
<font color="#7e7c7c">Still keeping your all-seeing eye
on me, Gabriel?</font>

140
00:21:33,501 --> 00:21:35,753
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm flattered.</font>

141
00:21:36,504 --> 00:21:38,672
<font color="#7e7c7c">I could offer something</font>

142
00:21:38,673 --> 00:21:43,093
<font color="#7e7c7c">about how a shepherd leads
even the most wayward of his flock,</font>

143
00:21:43,094 --> 00:21:45,679
<font color="#7e7c7c">but it might sound
disingenuous.</font>

144
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:48,557
<font color="#7e7c7c">She has to have
a Catholic funeral.</font>

145
00:21:48,558 --> 00:21:53,061
<font color="#7e7c7c">- It's still considered a mortal sin.
- She didn't commit suicide.</font>

146
00:21:53,062 --> 00:21:57,275
<font color="#7e7c7c">The bishop believes otherwise.
You know the rules.</font>

147
00:21:57,817 --> 00:22:00,194
<font color="#7e7c7c">Father!</font>

148
00:22:00,445 --> 00:22:02,780
<font color="#7e7c7c">David.</font>

149
00:22:03,031 --> 00:22:05,282
<font color="#7e7c7c">This is Isabel.</font>

150
00:22:05,283 --> 00:22:09,619
<font color="#7e7c7c">God was the only one
she ever believed loved her.</font>

151
00:22:09,620 --> 00:22:12,832
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Please.
- I'm sorry.</font>

152
00:22:17,128 --> 00:22:20,756
<font color="#7e7c7c">I've been seeing some unusual
soul traffic lately.</font>

153
00:22:20,757 --> 00:22:23,842
<font color="#7e7c7c">You might consider
giving me an extension.</font>

154
00:22:23,843 --> 00:22:26,887
<font color="#7e7c7c">I could do your side some good
these days.</font>

155
00:22:26,888 --> 00:22:29,848
<font color="#7e7c7c">You still trying to buy
your way into heaven?</font>

156
00:22:29,849 --> 00:22:32,851
<font color="#7e7c7c">What about the minions
I've sent back?</font>

157
00:22:32,852 --> 00:22:37,063
<font color="#7e7c7c">- That alone should guarantee my entry.
- How many times have I told you?</font>

158
00:22:37,065 --> 00:22:42,236
<font color="#7e7c7c">- That's not the way this works.
- Haven't I served him enough?</font>

159
00:22:42,945 --> 00:22:46,656
<font color="#7e7c7c">- What does he want from me?
- Only the usual.</font>

160
00:22:46,657 --> 00:22:49,242
<font color="#7e7c7c">Self-sacrifice, belief.</font>

161
00:22:49,243 --> 00:22:52,704
<font color="#7e7c7c">- I believe, for Christ's sake.
- No, you know.</font>

162
00:22:52,705 --> 00:22:55,373
<font color="#7e7c7c">And there's a difference.
You've seen.</font>

163
00:22:55,375 --> 00:22:59,586
<font color="#7e7c7c">I never asked to see.
I was born with this curse.</font>

164
00:22:59,587 --> 00:23:04,674
<font color="#7e7c7c">A gift, John. One that you've
squandered on selfish endeavors.</font>

165
00:23:04,675 --> 00:23:09,597
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm pulling demons out of little girls.
Who's that for?</font>

166
00:23:11,307 --> 00:23:15,310
<font color="#7e7c7c">Everything you've ever done,
you've only ever done for yourself.</font>

167
00:23:15,311 --> 00:23:18,104
<font color="#7e7c7c">To earn your way
back into his good graces.</font>

168
00:23:18,106 --> 00:23:20,816
<font color="#7e7c7c">Impossible rules,
endless regulations...</font>

169
00:23:20,817 --> 00:23:24,153
<font color="#7e7c7c">Who goes up, who goes down
and why.</font>

170
00:23:28,908 --> 00:23:31,702
<font color="#7e7c7c">You don't even understand us.</font>

171
00:23:32,412 --> 00:23:36,541
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're the one who should go
to hell, half-breed.</font>

172
00:23:47,718 --> 00:23:50,430
<font color="#7e7c7c">Why me, Gabriel?</font>

173
00:23:51,139 --> 00:23:54,058
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's personal, isn't it?</font>

174
00:23:54,183 --> 00:23:58,688
<font color="#7e7c7c">I didn't go to church enough,
I didn't pray enough...</font>

175
00:23:59,397 --> 00:24:03,776
<font color="#7e7c7c">I was 5 bucks short
in the collection plate. Why?</font>

176
00:24:06,070 --> 00:24:08,238
<font color="#7e7c7c">You are going to die young,</font>

177
00:24:08,239 --> 00:24:13,244
<font color="#7e7c7c">because you smoked 30 cigarettes
a day since you were 15.</font>

178
00:24:13,494 --> 00:24:16,371
<font color="#7e7c7c">And you're going to go to hell</font>

179
00:24:16,372 --> 00:24:19,375
<font color="#7e7c7c">because of the life you took.</font>

180
00:24:24,213 --> 00:24:26,799
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're fucked.</font>

181
00:24:37,768 --> 00:24:40,271
<font color="#7e7c7c">At least it's nice out.</font>

182
00:24:42,690 --> 00:24:46,360
<font color="#7e7c7c">He always had a rotten
sense of humor.</font>

183
00:24:52,074 --> 00:24:55,578
<font color="#7e7c7c">And his punch lines are killers.</font>

184
00:25:01,375 --> 00:25:03,460
<font color="#7e7c7c">John!</font>

185
00:25:03,461 --> 00:25:06,339
<font color="#7e7c7c">Constantine, it's raining!</font>

186
00:25:19,852 --> 00:25:24,189
<font color="#7e7c7c">Twenty-two women were found buried
in the assailant's back yard.</font>

187
00:25:24,190 --> 00:25:28,401
<font color="#7e7c7c">So much damage had been done
to the bodies, police had to match...</font>

188
00:25:28,402 --> 00:25:32,906
<font color="#7e7c7c">She had been physically penetrated
over 100 times and buried alive.</font>

189
00:25:32,907 --> 00:25:37,118
<font color="#7e7c7c">Found locked in a storage freezer,
his head severed...</font>

190
00:25:37,119 --> 00:25:41,623
<font color="#7e7c7c">- He stuffed Holly's body into...
- He used a small handsaw...</font>

191
00:25:41,624 --> 00:25:46,378
<font color="#7e7c7c">Had nearly decapitated...
Even his eyes were gouged out.</font>

192
00:25:46,379 --> 00:25:48,923
<font color="#7e7c7c">Isabel!</font>

193
00:25:54,679 --> 00:25:57,807
<font color="#7e7c7c">Suicide in Psychiatric Ward</font>

194
00:26:12,363 --> 00:26:14,991
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm so sorry, Izzy.</font>

195
00:26:15,408 --> 00:26:17,910
<font color="#7e7c7c">Constantine.</font>

196
00:26:50,776 --> 00:26:52,944
<font color="#7e7c7c">Dodson.</font>

197
00:26:52,945 --> 00:26:55,489
<font color="#7e7c7c">Hello?</font>

198
00:27:02,830 --> 00:27:05,374
<font color="#7e7c7c">Hello?</font>

199
00:28:07,770 --> 00:28:10,606
<font color="#7e7c7c">Hey, buddy, got a light?</font>

200
00:28:40,970 --> 00:28:45,015
<font color="#7e7c7c">Should've minded
your own business, exorcist.</font>

201
00:29:07,121 --> 00:29:11,291
<font color="#7e7c7c">I know where you're going, John.
You're going to Midnite's.</font>

202
00:29:11,292 --> 00:29:13,626
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're supposed
to wait in the cab.</font>

203
00:29:13,627 --> 00:29:17,088
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's a haven for those who rise and fall.
I read about this.</font>

204
00:29:17,089 --> 00:29:20,884
<font color="#7e7c7c">- You read too much, kid. It's a bar.
- It's a bar?</font>

205
00:29:20,885 --> 00:29:25,138
<font color="#7e7c7c">Papa Midnite is a crusader for good.
He swore the oath of neutrality.</font>

206
00:29:25,139 --> 00:29:27,390
<font color="#7e7c7c">- The man's a legend.
- Yeah.</font>

207
00:29:27,391 --> 00:29:31,270
<font color="#7e7c7c">Can you please get me into this bar,
please? I'm begging you.</font>

208
00:29:32,438 --> 00:29:35,106
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Sure, you can get in.
- I can get in?</font>

209
00:29:35,107 --> 00:29:37,526
<font color="#7e7c7c">If you can get in.</font>

210
00:29:37,651 --> 00:29:41,822
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's a bear, though, right?
Or two ducks in a cloud?</font>

211
00:29:45,910 --> 00:29:48,412
<font color="#7e7c7c">Two frogs on a bench.</font>

212
00:29:51,999 --> 00:29:54,209
<font color="#7e7c7c">Two frogs on a bench.</font>

213
00:29:54,210 --> 00:29:57,880
<font color="#7e7c7c">No, I'm with the guy you just...
John!</font>

214
00:29:58,172 --> 00:30:00,674
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm with him, though.</font>

215
00:30:01,342 --> 00:30:03,844
<font color="#7e7c7c">Rat in a dress.</font>

216
00:30:04,220 --> 00:30:07,138
<font color="#7e7c7c">Of course it is.
Rat in a dress.</font>

217
00:30:07,139 --> 00:30:09,809
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm just testing.</font>

218
00:31:03,320 --> 00:31:05,906
<font color="#7e7c7c">Don't get up.</font>

219
00:31:06,365 --> 00:31:09,242
<font color="#7e7c7c">You've been absent some time.</font>

220
00:31:09,243 --> 00:31:12,495
<font color="#7e7c7c">Have you come here with relics to sell?</font>

221
00:31:12,496 --> 00:31:16,292
<font color="#7e7c7c">No, I'm out of that now.
I've been too busy.</font>

222
00:31:16,417 --> 00:31:21,338
<font color="#7e7c7c">Perhaps peddling forgeries has ended
up being bad for your health.</font>

223
00:31:21,964 --> 00:31:25,217
<font color="#7e7c7c">Midnite, I thought
the thing was authentic.</font>

224
00:31:28,137 --> 00:31:33,057
<font color="#7e7c7c">I see now. Your health is bad
for other reasons. How long?</font>

225
00:31:33,058 --> 00:31:38,397
<font color="#7e7c7c">- A few months, maybe a year.
- I thought I heard thunder last night.</font>

226
00:31:38,606 --> 00:31:42,192
<font color="#7e7c7c">Must have been
Satan's stomach growling.</font>

227
00:31:43,110 --> 00:31:46,529
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're the one soul he'd come
up here himself to collect.</font>

228
00:31:46,530 --> 00:31:49,033
<font color="#7e7c7c">So I've heard.</font>

229
00:31:50,034 --> 00:31:55,497
<font color="#7e7c7c">I am certain you did not come here
for a sympathetic shoulder to cry on.</font>

230
00:31:57,625 --> 00:32:01,669
<font color="#7e7c7c">A demon just attacked me,
right out in the open on Figueroa.</font>

231
00:32:01,670 --> 00:32:06,007
<font color="#7e7c7c">They don't like you, John. How many
have you deported back to hell?</font>

232
00:32:06,008 --> 00:32:10,386
<font color="#7e7c7c">Not some angry half-breed.
A full-fledged demon, on our plane.</font>

233
00:32:10,387 --> 00:32:13,806
<font color="#7e7c7c">Clearly I do not have to remind you
that is impossible.</font>

234
00:32:13,807 --> 00:32:16,100
<font color="#7e7c7c">And yesterday
I saw a soldier demon</font>

235
00:32:16,101 --> 00:32:19,395
<font color="#7e7c7c">trying to chew its way out
through a little girl.</font>

236
00:32:19,396 --> 00:32:23,191
<font color="#7e7c7c">John, demons stay
in hell, angels in heaven,</font>

237
00:32:23,192 --> 00:32:26,486
<font color="#7e7c7c">the great détente
of the original superpowers.</font>

238
00:32:26,487 --> 00:32:31,951
<font color="#7e7c7c">Thanks for the history lesson, Midnite.
You've been a tremendous help.</font>

239
00:32:35,079 --> 00:32:37,498
<font color="#7e7c7c">I need to use the chair.</font>

240
00:32:39,541 --> 00:32:44,379
<font color="#7e7c7c">John, forgetting the fact that it would
almost certainly kill you,</font>

241
00:32:44,380 --> 00:32:46,422
<font color="#7e7c7c">you know I am neutral.</font>

242
00:32:46,423 --> 00:32:50,844
<font color="#7e7c7c">And as long as the balance
is maintained, I take no sides.</font>

243
00:32:51,261 --> 00:32:54,263
<font color="#7e7c7c">Before you were a bartender,</font>

244
00:32:54,264 --> 00:32:58,978
<font color="#7e7c7c">you were one witch doctor
against, what, 30 Ashgar?</font>

245
00:32:59,853 --> 00:33:02,982
<font color="#7e7c7c">- And I...
- You were Constantine.</font>

246
00:33:03,565 --> 00:33:06,485
<font color="#7e7c7c">The John Constantine.</font>

247
00:33:07,111 --> 00:33:09,780
<font color="#7e7c7c">Once.</font>

248
00:33:10,155 --> 00:33:15,244
<font color="#7e7c7c">This isn't the usual game,
I can feel it. Something's coming.</font>

249
00:33:16,787 --> 00:33:19,205
<font color="#7e7c7c">Spooky.</font>

250
00:33:19,206 --> 00:33:21,082
<font color="#7e7c7c">Balthazar.</font>

251
00:33:21,083 --> 00:33:25,587
<font color="#7e7c7c">That expression alone
has made my entire night.</font>

252
00:33:25,838 --> 00:33:27,713
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'll make your night.</font>

253
00:33:27,715 --> 00:33:32,886
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'll deport your sorry ass right where
you stand, you half-breed shit!</font>

254
00:33:33,053 --> 00:33:37,974
<font color="#7e7c7c">You know the rules of my house.
While here, you will abide by them.</font>

255
00:33:37,975 --> 00:33:40,436
<font color="#7e7c7c">Johnny boy.</font>

256
00:33:42,396 --> 00:33:45,607
<font color="#7e7c7c">Word is you're on your way down.</font>

257
00:33:46,817 --> 00:33:49,278
<font color="#7e7c7c">Fresh meat.</font>

258
00:33:52,322 --> 00:33:54,825
<font color="#7e7c7c">Finger-licking good.</font>

259
00:33:55,075 --> 00:33:57,995
<font color="#7e7c7c">We have a meeting now, John.</font>

260
00:34:05,002 --> 00:34:07,671
<font color="#7e7c7c">What? I didn't catch that.</font>

261
00:34:50,422 --> 00:34:52,925
<font color="#7e7c7c">Welcome to my life.</font>

262
00:35:02,601 --> 00:35:05,187
<font color="#7e7c7c">Mr. Constantine.</font>

263
00:35:06,021 --> 00:35:08,773
<font color="#7e7c7c">- I saw you...
- I remember.</font>

264
00:35:08,774 --> 00:35:12,820
<font color="#7e7c7c">- And then I saw you at the...
- Regular kismet.</font>

265
00:35:13,153 --> 00:35:16,948
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'd like to ask you a few questions,
if that would be okay.</font>

266
00:35:16,949 --> 00:35:20,451
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm not really in the talking mood
right now.</font>

267
00:35:20,452 --> 00:35:23,997
<font color="#7e7c7c">Maybe you could just listen then.
Please?</font>

268
00:35:29,128 --> 00:35:31,547
<font color="#7e7c7c">Always a catch.</font>

269
00:35:45,769 --> 00:35:48,563
<font color="#7e7c7c">My sister was murdered
yesterday.</font>

270
00:35:48,564 --> 00:35:51,150
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Sorry to hear.
- Thanks.</font>

271
00:35:51,900 --> 00:35:56,488
<font color="#7e7c7c">She was a patient at Ravenscar.
She jumped off the roof.</font>

272
00:35:57,406 --> 00:35:59,824
<font color="#7e7c7c">Thought you said
she was murdered.</font>

273
00:35:59,825 --> 00:36:02,910
<font color="#7e7c7c">Isabel wouldn't
have taken her own life.</font>

274
00:36:02,911 --> 00:36:08,167
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah. What kind of mental patient
kills herself? That's just crazy.</font>

275
00:36:13,463 --> 00:36:17,050
<font color="#7e7c7c">Look, I've heard your name
around the precinct.</font>

276
00:36:17,259 --> 00:36:22,514
<font color="#7e7c7c">I know the circles you travel in.
The occult, demonology, exorcisms.</font>

277
00:36:22,764 --> 00:36:26,809
<font color="#7e7c7c">Just before my sister was committed,
she became deeply paranoid.</font>

278
00:36:26,810 --> 00:36:30,689
<font color="#7e7c7c">She started talking about demons, angels.</font>

279
00:36:31,565 --> 00:36:34,692
<font color="#7e7c7c">Now, I think someone got to her,
Mr. Constantine.</font>

280
00:36:34,693 --> 00:36:38,446
<font color="#7e7c7c">I think they brainwashed her
into stepping off that roof.</font>

281
00:36:38,447 --> 00:36:41,742
<font color="#7e7c7c">Some kind of legion or cult.</font>

282
00:36:43,118 --> 00:36:47,164
<font color="#7e7c7c">Sounds like a theory, detective.
Good luck.</font>

283
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:54,754
<font color="#7e7c7c">I thought that with your background, you
could point me in the right direction.</font>

284
00:36:54,755 --> 00:36:57,257
<font color="#7e7c7c">Okay, sure.</font>

285
00:37:00,219 --> 00:37:04,639
<font color="#7e7c7c">It wasn't a suicide.
My sister was a devout Catholic.</font>

286
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:07,266
<font color="#7e7c7c">If she's taken her own life...</font>

287
00:37:07,267 --> 00:37:10,144
<font color="#7e7c7c">Her soul would go
straight to hell,</font>

288
00:37:10,145 --> 00:37:15,524
<font color="#7e7c7c">where she'd be ripped apart over
and over in screaming, brutal agony,</font>

289
00:37:15,525 --> 00:37:18,278
<font color="#7e7c7c">for all eternity.</font>

290
00:37:18,946 --> 00:37:21,490
<font color="#7e7c7c">That about right?</font>

291
00:37:28,080 --> 00:37:30,582
<font color="#7e7c7c">Goddamn you!</font>

292
00:38:00,696 --> 00:38:02,405
<font color="#7e7c7c">Detective.</font>

293
00:38:02,406 --> 00:38:05,866
<font color="#7e7c7c">What if I told you that God
and the devil made a wager,</font>

294
00:38:05,867 --> 00:38:09,120
<font color="#7e7c7c">a kind of standing bet
for the souls of all mankind?</font>

295
00:38:09,121 --> 00:38:11,622
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'd tell you to stay on
your meds.</font>

296
00:38:11,623 --> 00:38:16,168
<font color="#7e7c7c">Humor me. No direct contact with
humans. That would be the rule.</font>

297
00:38:16,169 --> 00:38:20,548
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Just influence. See who would win.
- Okay, I'm humoring you.</font>

298
00:38:20,549 --> 00:38:22,758
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Why?
- Who knows.</font>

299
00:38:22,759 --> 00:38:25,970
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Maybe for the fun of it. No telling.
- So it's fun.</font>

300
00:38:25,971 --> 00:38:31,100
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's fun when a man beats his wife to
death, when a mother drowns her baby.</font>

301
00:38:31,101 --> 00:38:34,938
<font color="#7e7c7c">And you think
the devil is responsible?</font>

302
00:38:35,105 --> 00:38:38,065
<font color="#7e7c7c">People are evil, Mr. Constantine.
People.</font>

303
00:38:38,066 --> 00:38:41,694
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're right. We're born
capable of terrible things.</font>

304
00:38:41,695 --> 00:38:46,073
<font color="#7e7c7c">Then something else comes along
and gives us just the right nudge.</font>

305
00:38:46,074 --> 00:38:50,953
<font color="#7e7c7c">This has been real educational,
but I don't believe in the devil.</font>

306
00:38:50,954 --> 00:38:54,207
<font color="#7e7c7c">You should.
He believes in you.</font>

307
00:39:14,728 --> 00:39:18,648
<font color="#7e7c7c">- It's a power outage.
- Not likely.</font>

308
00:39:21,693 --> 00:39:24,446
<font color="#7e7c7c">- What?
- We should go. Now.</font>

309
00:39:30,285 --> 00:39:32,788
<font color="#7e7c7c">What is that?</font>

310
00:39:33,330 --> 00:39:35,706
<font color="#7e7c7c">Wings.</font>

311
00:39:35,707 --> 00:39:38,168
<font color="#7e7c7c">Maybe talons.</font>

312
00:39:38,293 --> 00:39:41,338
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're kidding. Of what?</font>

313
00:39:41,797 --> 00:39:45,509
<font color="#7e7c7c">Something that's not
supposed to be here.</font>

314
00:39:49,012 --> 00:39:52,182
<font color="#7e7c7c">That's really not going to help.</font>

315
00:39:56,186 --> 00:39:59,064
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Close your eyes.
- Why?</font>

316
00:39:59,231 --> 00:40:01,775
<font color="#7e7c7c">Suit yourself.</font>

317
00:40:23,046 --> 00:40:25,841
<font color="#7e7c7c">Demons stay in hell, huh?</font>

318
00:40:27,300 --> 00:40:29,636
<font color="#7e7c7c">Tell them that.</font>

319
00:40:31,513 --> 00:40:35,767
<font color="#7e7c7c">Don't worry. Happens to everyone
the first time.</font>

320
00:40:36,643 --> 00:40:39,146
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's the sulfur.</font>

321
00:40:39,271 --> 00:40:41,982
<font color="#7e7c7c">Sulfur.</font>

322
00:40:43,483 --> 00:40:46,486
<font color="#7e7c7c">What were those things?</font>

323
00:40:47,154 --> 00:40:49,656
<font color="#7e7c7c">Demons.</font>

324
00:40:50,574 --> 00:40:55,244
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Scavengers of the damned.
- No. It's impossible.</font>

325
00:40:55,245 --> 00:40:59,374
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah. And I don't think
they were after me.</font>

326
00:41:01,418 --> 00:41:04,795
<font color="#7e7c7c">You really believe
she wouldn't commit suicide.</font>

327
00:41:04,796 --> 00:41:07,799
<font color="#7e7c7c">Isabel?
Never in a million years.</font>

328
00:41:09,134 --> 00:41:11,510
<font color="#7e7c7c">Well, let's be sure.</font>

329
00:41:11,511 --> 00:41:14,514
<font color="#7e7c7c">Let's see if she's in hell.</font>

330
00:41:38,413 --> 00:41:41,123
<font color="#7e7c7c">Was it supposed
to be hot or cold?</font>

331
00:41:41,124 --> 00:41:43,668
<font color="#7e7c7c">In front of the chair.</font>

332
00:41:46,087 --> 00:41:48,255
<font color="#7e7c7c">I can't believe I'm doing this.</font>

333
00:41:48,256 --> 00:41:51,718
<font color="#7e7c7c">- These are all Isabel's things?
- Yeah.</font>

334
00:41:52,010 --> 00:41:55,388
<font color="#7e7c7c">- How about the cat?
- Duck? Yeah, why?</font>

335
00:41:57,516 --> 00:41:59,308
<font color="#7e7c7c">Duck.</font>

336
00:41:59,309 --> 00:42:03,187
<font color="#7e7c7c">- You think that's strange.
- Cats are good.</font>

337
00:42:03,188 --> 00:42:06,066
<font color="#7e7c7c">Half in, half out anyway.</font>

338
00:42:23,166 --> 00:42:26,460
<font color="#7e7c7c">If this is some kind of spell
or something,</font>

339
00:42:26,461 --> 00:42:29,964
<font color="#7e7c7c">don't you need candles
and a pentagram for it to work?</font>

340
00:42:29,965 --> 00:42:32,591
<font color="#7e7c7c">Why, do you have any?</font>

341
00:42:32,592 --> 00:42:35,470
<font color="#7e7c7c">- This is crazy.
- Yes.</font>

342
00:42:39,099 --> 00:42:41,685
<font color="#7e7c7c">I need you to leave.</font>

343
00:42:42,185 --> 00:42:45,313
<font color="#7e7c7c">- I'm sorry?
- Angela, please.</font>

344
00:42:49,317 --> 00:42:51,820
<font color="#7e7c7c">The apartment.</font>

345
00:42:53,572 --> 00:42:56,074
<font color="#7e7c7c">Okay.</font>

346
00:43:01,413 --> 00:43:04,165
<font color="#7e7c7c">Be careful with that cat.</font>

347
00:43:08,211 --> 00:43:10,672
<font color="#7e7c7c">God, I hate this part.</font>

348
00:45:13,878 --> 00:45:16,715
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Isabel.
- Constantine.</font>

349
00:46:02,218 --> 00:46:04,512
<font color="#7e7c7c">Angela.</font>

350
00:46:06,598 --> 00:46:09,184
<font color="#7e7c7c">Jesus!</font>

351
00:46:12,771 --> 00:46:15,190
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Constantine, what...?
- Twins.</font>

352
00:46:15,315 --> 00:46:17,399
<font color="#7e7c7c">What?</font>

353
00:46:17,400 --> 00:46:20,319
<font color="#7e7c7c">- You were twins.
- What did you say?</font>

354
00:46:20,320 --> 00:46:23,239
<font color="#7e7c7c">- She killed herself.
- What?</font>

