to all that was intended.</font>

713
01:35:03,365 --> 01:35:07,327
<font color="#7e7c7c">By handing Earth over
to the son of the devil?</font>

714
01:35:07,703 --> 01:35:10,288
<font color="#7e7c7c">Help me here.</font>

715
01:35:13,166 --> 01:35:16,962
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're handed
this precious gift, right?</font>

716
01:35:18,672 --> 01:35:23,260
<font color="#7e7c7c">Each one of you granted redemption
from the Creator.</font>

717
01:35:23,677 --> 01:35:26,512
<font color="#7e7c7c">Murderers, rapists and molesters.</font>

718
01:35:26,513 --> 01:35:31,435
<font color="#7e7c7c">All of you, you just have to repent,
and God takes you into his bosom.</font>

719
01:35:34,062 --> 01:35:36,689
<font color="#7e7c7c">In all the worlds,
in all the universe,</font>

720
01:35:36,690 --> 01:35:40,610
<font color="#7e7c7c">no other creature can make
such a boast, save man.</font>

721
01:35:41,903 --> 01:35:44,489
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's not fair.</font>

722
01:35:47,284 --> 01:35:50,871
<font color="#7e7c7c">If sweet, sweet God
loves you so,</font>

723
01:35:51,371 --> 01:35:55,083
<font color="#7e7c7c">then I'll make you
worthy of his love.</font>

724
01:35:56,168 --> 01:35:59,503
<font color="#7e7c7c">I've been watching you
for a long time.</font>

725
01:35:59,504 --> 01:36:04,383
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's only in the face of horror
that you truly find your nobler selves.</font>

726
01:36:04,384 --> 01:36:07,095
<font color="#7e7c7c">And you can be so noble.</font>

727
01:36:10,807 --> 01:36:13,810
<font color="#7e7c7c">So, I'll bring you pain.</font>

728
01:36:16,062 --> 01:36:19,107
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'll bring you horror.</font>

729
01:36:20,150 --> 01:36:23,236
<font color="#7e7c7c">So that you may rise above it.</font>

730
01:36:26,698 --> 01:36:30,451
<font color="#7e7c7c">So that those of you who survive
this reign of hell on Earth</font>

731
01:36:30,452 --> 01:36:33,871
<font color="#7e7c7c">will be worthy of God's love.</font>

732
01:36:33,872 --> 01:36:37,542
<font color="#7e7c7c">Gabriel, you're insane!</font>

733
01:36:40,253 --> 01:36:43,965
<font color="#7e7c7c">The road to salvation
begins tonight.</font>

734
01:36:44,382 --> 01:36:46,927
<font color="#7e7c7c">Right now.</font>

735
01:37:28,051 --> 01:37:31,429
<font color="#7e7c7c">I know I'm not one
of your favorites.</font>

736
01:37:32,222 --> 01:37:35,433
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'm not even welcome
in your house.</font>

737
01:37:36,560 --> 01:37:39,980
<font color="#7e7c7c">But I could use
a little attention.</font>

738
01:37:42,732 --> 01:37:45,193
<font color="#7e7c7c">Please.</font>

739
01:38:30,864 --> 01:38:33,366
<font color="#7e7c7c">Come forth.</font>

740
01:38:53,011 --> 01:38:55,305
<font color="#7e7c7c">Hurry.</font>

741
01:39:12,280 --> 01:39:15,408
<font color="#7e7c7c">Mammon, son of Satan,</font>

742
01:39:16,785 --> 01:39:19,996
<font color="#7e7c7c">I unleash you unto this world.</font>

743
01:40:15,135 --> 01:40:18,346
<font color="#7e7c7c">Lu, what took you so long?</font>

744
01:40:18,555 --> 01:40:21,224
<font color="#7e7c7c">Hello, John.</font>

745
01:40:29,941 --> 01:40:32,610
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're the one soul</font>

746
01:40:33,194 --> 01:40:36,865
<font color="#7e7c7c">I would come up here
to collect myself.</font>

747
01:40:40,201 --> 01:40:42,662
<font color="#7e7c7c">So I've heard.</font>

748
01:40:43,580 --> 01:40:45,999
<font color="#7e7c7c">You mind?</font>

749
01:40:46,124 --> 01:40:49,334
<font color="#7e7c7c">Go right ahead.
I've got stock.</font>

750
01:40:49,335 --> 01:40:52,756
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Coffin nail.
- Very fitting, John.</font>

751
01:40:55,842 --> 01:40:59,428
<font color="#7e7c7c">You know, when you cut too deep,
you cut the tendons.</font>

752
01:40:59,429 --> 01:41:03,850
<font color="#7e7c7c">Finger movement goes out
the window. Let me help you.</font>

753
01:41:15,779 --> 01:41:18,031
<font color="#7e7c7c">See?</font>

754
01:41:19,365 --> 01:41:25,413
<font color="#7e7c7c">Sonny, I've got a whole theme park
full of red delights for you.</font>

755
01:41:26,831 --> 01:41:29,334
<font color="#7e7c7c">Aren't you a peach.</font>

756
01:41:30,085 --> 01:41:34,547
<font color="#7e7c7c">I didn't think you would
make the same mistake twice.</font>

757
01:41:38,802 --> 01:41:41,679
<font color="#7e7c7c">And you didn't, did you?</font>

758
01:41:43,515 --> 01:41:45,641
<font color="#7e7c7c">So how's the family?</font>

759
01:41:45,642 --> 01:41:50,438
<font color="#7e7c7c">Family's doing just fine.
Busy, busy, busy. Need a vacation.</font>

760
01:41:51,940 --> 01:41:55,526
<font color="#7e7c7c">Word is that kid of yours
is a chip off the old block.</font>

761
01:41:55,527 --> 01:41:58,612
<font color="#7e7c7c">Well, one does what one can.</font>

762
01:41:58,613 --> 01:42:02,450
<font color="#7e7c7c">- He's in the other room.
- Boys will be boys.</font>

763
01:42:04,244 --> 01:42:06,871
<font color="#7e7c7c">With Gabriel.</font>

764
01:42:08,581 --> 01:42:11,667
<font color="#7e7c7c">No accounting for taste, really.</font>

765
01:42:11,668 --> 01:42:14,921
<font color="#7e7c7c">They have the Spear of Destiny.</font>

766
01:42:16,881 --> 01:42:20,343
<font color="#7e7c7c">"They have the Spear of Destiny."</font>

767
01:42:28,852 --> 01:42:32,230
<font color="#7e7c7c">Or is it another
one of your cons?</font>

768
01:42:33,940 --> 01:42:36,818
<font color="#7e7c7c">Go look for yourself.</font>

769
01:42:39,487 --> 01:42:45,118
<font color="#7e7c7c">You've waited 20 years for me, Lu.
What's another 20 seconds?</font>

770
01:43:51,267 --> 01:43:55,563
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Lucifer.
- This world is mine. In time.</font>

771
01:43:56,689 --> 01:44:02,904
<font color="#7e7c7c">You, best of all of us, Gabriel,
should understand ambition.</font>

772
01:44:04,822 --> 01:44:07,533
<font color="#7e7c7c">Son of perdition.</font>

773
01:44:08,326 --> 01:44:10,787
<font color="#7e7c7c">Little horn.</font>

774
01:44:11,663 --> 01:44:16,125
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Most unclean.
- I do miss the old names.</font>

775
01:44:17,627 --> 01:44:20,045
<font color="#7e7c7c">Time to go home, son.</font>

776
01:44:20,046 --> 01:44:24,259
<font color="#7e7c7c">I will smite thee
in his honor!</font>

777
01:44:30,556 --> 01:44:35,270
<font color="#7e7c7c">Looks like somebody doesn't
have your back anymore.</font>

778
01:44:53,454 --> 01:44:55,790
<font color="#7e7c7c">Father?</font>

779
01:45:18,855 --> 01:45:21,190
<font color="#7e7c7c">So.</font>

780
01:45:27,363 --> 01:45:29,156
<font color="#7e7c7c">So.</font>

781
01:45:29,157 --> 01:45:32,618
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah, what do you want?
An extension?</font>

782
01:45:37,457 --> 01:45:40,084
<font color="#7e7c7c">The sister...</font>

783
01:45:40,543 --> 01:45:43,004
<font color="#7e7c7c">Isabel.</font>

784
01:45:43,588 --> 01:45:46,257
<font color="#7e7c7c">What about her?</font>

785
01:45:47,508 --> 01:45:50,011
<font color="#7e7c7c">Let her go home.</font>

786
01:45:52,680 --> 01:45:57,435
<font color="#7e7c7c">You're willing to give up your life
so she can go to heaven?</font>

787
01:46:06,986 --> 01:46:09,489
<font color="#7e7c7c">Fine. It's done.</font>

788
01:46:12,700 --> 01:46:15,495
<font color="#7e7c7c">Time to go, John.</font>

789
01:46:16,454 --> 01:46:18,790
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah.</font>

790
01:47:16,013 --> 01:47:18,683
<font color="#7e7c7c">The sacrifice.</font>

791
01:47:29,652 --> 01:47:33,656
<font color="#7e7c7c">No. This one belongs to me.</font>

792
01:47:45,585 --> 01:47:50,256
<font color="#7e7c7c">No. You will live,
John Constantine.</font>

793
01:47:54,385 --> 01:47:56,971
<font color="#7e7c7c">You will live.</font>

794
01:47:59,265 --> 01:48:02,143
<font color="#7e7c7c">So you will have</font>

795
01:48:02,643 --> 01:48:05,688
<font color="#7e7c7c">the chance to prove</font>

796
01:48:07,899 --> 01:48:11,944
<font color="#7e7c7c">that your soul truly
belongs in hell.</font>

797
01:48:16,491 --> 01:48:19,243
<font color="#7e7c7c">You will live.</font>

798
01:48:23,789 --> 01:48:26,501
<font color="#7e7c7c">You will live.</font>

799
01:49:41,409 --> 01:49:43,828
<font color="#7e7c7c">Thank you.</font>

800
01:49:45,746 --> 01:49:48,165
<font color="#7e7c7c">No problem.</font>

801
01:50:03,848 --> 01:50:06,350
<font color="#7e7c7c">Human.</font>

802
01:50:07,643 --> 01:50:10,688
<font color="#7e7c7c">You don't deserve to be human.</font>

803
01:50:11,522 --> 01:50:16,360
<font color="#7e7c7c">Do you want revenge?
Is that what you're thinking right now?</font>

804
01:50:18,487 --> 01:50:20,781
<font color="#7e7c7c">Do it.</font>

805
01:50:24,660 --> 01:50:27,872
<font color="#7e7c7c">Seek revenge.
End my life.</font>

806
01:50:30,166 --> 01:50:32,585
<font color="#7e7c7c">Go on.</font>

807
01:50:33,628 --> 01:50:36,797
<font color="#7e7c7c">Be the hand of God.
It's your choice.</font>

808
01:50:37,632 --> 01:50:40,509
<font color="#7e7c7c">It's always been your choice.</font>

809
01:50:45,431 --> 01:50:47,808
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah.</font>

810
01:50:52,813 --> 01:50:56,275
<font color="#7e7c7c">That's called pain.
Get used to it.</font>

811
01:51:02,907 --> 01:51:05,951
<font color="#7e7c7c">You could've shot me, John!</font>

812
01:51:07,203 --> 01:51:09,955
<font color="#7e7c7c">You chose a higher path!</font>

813
01:51:11,499 --> 01:51:14,669
<font color="#7e7c7c">Look how well you're doing!</font>

814
01:51:39,944 --> 01:51:42,238
<font color="#7e7c7c">Nice spot.</font>

815
01:51:46,158 --> 01:51:48,869
<font color="#7e7c7c">I have something for you.</font>

816
01:51:50,496 --> 01:51:54,834
<font color="#7e7c7c">Something tells me
you're not a flowers kind of guy.</font>

817
01:51:56,502 --> 01:51:58,838
<font color="#7e7c7c">How thoughtful.</font>

818
01:52:07,513 --> 01:52:11,016
<font color="#7e7c7c">- Why are you giving me this?
- Rules.</font>

819
01:52:11,851 --> 01:52:16,897
<font color="#7e7c7c">Hide it. Somewhere no one
will ever be able to find it.</font>

820
01:52:17,356 --> 01:52:19,942
<font color="#7e7c7c">Not even me.</font>

821
01:52:23,404 --> 01:52:25,990
<font color="#7e7c7c">Always a catch.</font>

822
01:52:26,615 --> 01:52:29,076
<font color="#7e7c7c">Yeah.</font>

823
01:52:41,422 --> 01:52:43,632
<font color="#7e7c7c">So...</font>

824
01:52:44,759 --> 01:52:47,803
<font color="#7e7c7c">I've got some
cleaning up to do.</font>

825
01:52:51,599 --> 01:52:54,560
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'II see you around.</font>

826
01:52:58,522 --> 01:53:01,192
<font color="#7e7c7c">I'd like that.</font>

827
01:53:30,679 --> 01:53:33,640
<font color="#7e7c7c">I guess there's
a plan for all of us.</font>

828
01:53:33,641 --> 01:53:36,268
<font color="#7e7c7c">I had to die twice</font>

829
01:53:36,477 --> 01:53:39,229
<font color="#7e7c7c">just to figure that out.</font>

830
01:53:39,230 --> 01:53:44,193
<font color="#7e7c7c">Like the book says, he works
his work in mysterious ways.</font>

831
01:53:44,401 --> 01:53:46,694
<font color="#7e7c7c">Some people like it,</font>

832
01:53:46,695 --> 01:53:49,240
<font color="#7e7c7c">some people don't.</font>

833
01:59:42,759 --> 01:59:45,220
<font color="#7e7c7c">You did good, kid.</font>

834
02:00:23,342 --> 02:00:26,637
<font color="#7e7c7c">CONSTANTINE</font>

